    "title": "Shooting Incident Involving Charlie Kirk at Utah Valley University",
    "text": "• Charlie Kirk was shot on September 10, 2025, during a rally at Utah Valley University.\n• The shooting occurred at approximately 12:20 p.m. near the food court on campus.\n• Initial reports indicated that a suspect was in custody, but later updates clarified that the individual was not the shooter.\n• Authorities confirmed that the shooter wore dark clothing and fired from a roof some distance away.\n• The Utah Department of Public Safety stated that no one is currently in custody regarding Kirk's killing.\n• FBI Director Kash Patel initially reported that a subject was in custody but later confirmed that this individual was released after interrogation.\n• A new person of interest is being sought in connection with the assassination of Charlie Kirk.\n• The campus was evacuated following the shooting, and police are continuing their investigation.\n• Bystanders reported that Kirk was shot near his neck during a Q&A session with students.",
